    "OtherAbstract": {
      "Type": "AIDS",
      "Language": "eng",
      "AbstractText": "HIV-positive patients with hemophilia must consider the consequences of treatments on their difficulty with blood clotting. This standard of care paper sets forth recommendations for people with hemophilia and HIV infection, including specific recommendations for those with severe deficiency of factor VIII or IX. The recommendations address physician choices, hepatitis infection, bleeding issues, orthopedics, psychosocial issues, and finances."
    }
